1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,800
Clean hands keep germs away! Wet your hands with clean water and add a drop of soap.

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:09,800
Rub your palms together, scrub between your fingers, and count to twenty while making soapy bubbles!

3
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:14,800
Rinse away the bubbles with water and dry your clean hands on a fresh towel!
